Description: Shiny web application to browse, search, and preview 'metasurvey'
    recipes and workflows, part of the 'metasurvey' ecosystem. Launch it with
    'explore_recipes()'. The app talks to a deployed 'metasurvey' API through the
    'metasurvey.explorer.backend' client and renders 'metasurvey.core' recipe and
    workflow objects as documentation cards.
